================= Compute Engine ================

Compute Engine – Virtual machines running in Google’s infrastructure.

App Engine – Fully managed platform for building and deploying apps.

Kubernetes Engine (GKE) – Managed Kubernetes for containerized workloads.

Cloud Functions – Event-driven, serverless compute service.

Cloud Run – Fully managed container runtime without server management.

Bare Metal Solution – Dedicated physical servers for specialized workloads.
